`tp accept` was not used to completion: in this workspace its whole-store layer-4 pass cannot replay the stored
record (the record's toolchain key includes the Python version, 3.13 here) and reruns every entity, well over an
hour per call. The folders were copied as `tp accept` copies them (without proposal.json). Layers 1 to 3 of the
whole store and layer 4 on the changed entities are run in the workspace; the pull request's required check runs
layer 4 in full.
